---
description: Core repo rules for every agent turn
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/plans/README.md` before editing.
Run `cargo xtask gate fast` before finishing a change.
No emoji, no em dashes, no en dashes in tracked text.
No personal data (names, IPs, hostnames, user paths) in the repo.
Generated files are read-only until `cargo xtask gen` exists (phase 11).
If the task text and the code disagree, the code wins: stop and report.
PROTECTED edits need user-provided ADR number and trailer `ADR: NNNN`.
Never kill or restart a running Kuro from a script or test.
One phase file or one scoped task per PR.
Soft target 200 lines per file, cap 400 unless allowlisted.